      <div class="grid grid--2 mt-2">
        <Card title="Choose sea when...">
          <ul>
            <li>The cargo is heavy, bulky, palletised or containerised.</li>
            <li>Your planning window can absorb the typical 22-day ocean move.</li>
            <li>The landed cost matters more than the final delivery speed.</li>
            <li>The consignment is destined for Doha or any Qatar site close to Hamad.</li>
          </ul>
        </Card>
        <Card title="Choose air or express when...">
