            <li>The goods are high-value, light, perishable or time-critical.</li>
            <li>A production line or customer order cannot wait for ocean transit.</li>
            <li>The shipment is small enough for courier or airport-to-airport handling.</li>
            <li>The speed premium is lower than the cost of delay.</li>
          </ul>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

