      The origin side is the familiar China port hierarchy. Shanghai and Ningbo-Zhoushan anchor the
      East China ocean services; Shenzhen and Guangzhou cover South China. On the Qatar side, Hamad
      Port is the only commercial container destination you should book for a new China consignment.
    </p>

